# Клиника Одинцова — Tech Stack & Core Principles

## Stack
- **Runtime**: Bun (not npm/yarn)
- **Framework**: Astro 4 + React 18 islands (JSX — no TypeScript)
- **Routing**: Astro file-based routing (not React Router) — pages in `src/pages/*.astro`
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 3 + custom clay utility classes in `src/styles/global.css`
- **CSS library**: `claymorphism-css` (imported in global.css)
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **Language**: JavaScript (`.jsx` files), Russian content

## Architecture
- Pages are `.astro` files in `src/pages/` — they import React components from `src/components/pages/`
- Layout wrapper: `src/layouts/Layout.astro` — wraps all pages via `<slot />`
- Only `Header.jsx` uses `client:load` (interactive); all other components are server-rendered (SSG)
- Dev server runs at `localhost:4321` (Astro default)

## Key Principles
- Write concise, functional, declarative code — avoid classes
- Prefer iteration and modularization over duplication
- Use descriptive variable names with auxiliary verbs (`isLoading`, `hasError`, `canSubmit`)
- Use lowercase with dashes for directories (`components/clay-card`, `pages/second-opinion`)
- Favor **named exports** for all components
- Use the **RORO pattern** (Receive an Object, Return an Object) for functions with multiple params

## JavaScript Style
- Use `function` keyword for components and pure functions — not `const`
- Omit semicolons
- File structure order: exported component → subcomponents → helpers → static content
- Avoid unnecessary curly braces in single-line conditionals
- Use `if (condition) doSomething()` for simple guards

## Documentation (README)
- После любых изменений в проекте **обновлять файл README.md**, чтобы он отражал актуальное состояние (новые страницы, фичи, структура, команды и т.д.).
- **Исключение**: если пользователь явно указывает, что работа тестовая/экспериментальная (например: «тестовая страница», «тестовый проект», «просто проверяем»), README обновлять не нужно.

## Running the project
```bash
bun run dev      # start dev server at localhost:4321
bun run build    # production build
bun run preview  # preview build
```
